{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 80780, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 56058, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "8-9月日历分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1624254848, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1625293946, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 31, "status": 1, "summary": "根据官方给出的活动日历可知接下来的活动顺序为：火WB-光Raid-暗翻牌现给出新天子评价方便各位规划钻石：抽卡优先级：PVP重度爱好者：兔女郎+6其他全都图鉴，PVE摆烂就完事了，最近几个月PVP环境", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624524047945_14250572.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523431952_7739129.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523158975_35762713.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 17, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 19459, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 80780, "content": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">根据官方给出的活动日历可知接下来的活动顺序为：火WB-光Raid-暗翻牌</span></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523158975_35762713.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523158975_35762713.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div></span><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624355815891_37918243.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624355815891_37918243.png\"></div></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">现给出新天子评价方便各位规划钻石：</span></div><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523431952_7739129.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523431952_7739129.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,176,240);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\">抽卡优先级：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">PVP重度爱好者：</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">兔女郎+6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">其他全都图鉴，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">PVE摆烂就完事了，最近几个月PVP环境冲击太大，没有多余的钻石匀给PVE</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">PVE重度爱好者：</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">墨丘利+2＞提瓦兹+2＞墨丘利+6＞提瓦兹+6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">其他全部图鉴，PVP也是摆烂，没有兔女郎一样是50胜低保户，没什么影响</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">老咸鱼/无主见玩家：</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">兔女郎+2＞墨丘利+2＞提瓦兹+2＞墨丘利+6＞兔女郎+6＞提瓦兹+6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">自建号/新入坑萌新：</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">兔女郎+2＞兔女郎+6＞墨丘利+2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">墨丘利由于需要点火才泛用，优先级不是很高，把所有钻石投入兔女郎，再点火2红，带你PVP上分、剧情图通关、重生迷宫5-3全都无压力。</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">日历Bonus：</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">①已知7月将会开启<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">免费十连活动</span>，可能是两周也可能是一个月。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">②7月将会引来持续1个月的<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">丽莎作业活动</span>，国际服应该会在7月底引来丽莎作业（韩服已经实装，送三位P胎五，四位P胎四）</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">③此次火WB将会开启2次</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">双倍伤害活动</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">，国际服应该要第一次突破200车了。</span><br></div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">④日历上没有无限乱斗，说明</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">无限乱斗在8月12后</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">，极大可能是8月底伴随火WB/Raid实装。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">后续日历预测：</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">接下来我们会迎来 火WB——（无限乱斗）——火Raid——暗＆木翻牌</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">给出新天子评价：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624524047945_14250572.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624524047945_14250572.png\"></div><br></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624524047945_14250572.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523431952_7739129.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624523158975_35762713.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/